Built the sprint board in plain TypeScript and DOM under `src/` (`main.ts` default-exports `mount`; logic in `board.ts`, `archive.ts`, with helpers in `dom.ts` and `styles.ts`). `./check` is clean and all 26 visible tests pass. I used 8 of the 15 check/test runs. Unsure: the hidden tests may probe edge cases I chose without the brief's guidance, such as an empty rename or checklist add while loading, and whether the one 404 in the test log, which I did not identify, matters.